Historical flavor events for France, from 1936 to the end of the Phoney War in spring 1940. Each event is drawn from a sourced moment of the period, from politics and everyday life to culture, the empire and the defence of the country. Most show a photograph; the rest use the game's own event art. The events give small effects and leave vanilla France's own focuses and events alone.

